    "$type": "dimension",
    "$description": "Five roles, and no sixth. Display and title tighten because a geometric sans sets loose as it grows; body barely does; a code loosens so two capitals of near-equal width stay apart; micro-caps loosen a lot so three 11px capitals read as a label and not a word.",
